<x-screen-instructions :title="__('How to use Payment Corrections')">
    <p>{{ __('A read-only log of every change to what a visit paid: door entries converted to a subscription the same night, and visits refunded at the desk soon after check-in. It shows who did it, why, and what was collected or refunded. Nothing here can be edited or deleted.') }}</p>
    <p>{!! __('Corrections are made only from the <strong>Check-In Desk</strong>: select the member who\'s already checked in tonight, then use <strong>Convert entry to subscription</strong> (Manager and up) or <strong>Refund visit</strong> (Door and up, when the club turns it on, within a short time of check-in). The money is settled on the visit\'s own register shift, with the same payment method. A refunded visit stays on the member\'s record, marked departed.') !!}</p>
</x-screen-instructions>
